# Compliance (HK)

Renocheck aggregates **public** sources and algorithmic summaries — not accusations. Use `[Certain]` / `[Likely]` / `[Guessing]` for substantive compliance claims (see `advisor-conduct`).

## Wording

- ✅ 「根據公開討論摘要，出現多宗與裝修糾紛相關的提及」
- ❌ 「該公司係黑店 / 一定會爛尾」

## Data handling

- Normalize HK phones for matching; minimize stored PII; hashed cache fingerprints.
- Public search only: snippets and URLs; respect provider ToS; do not persist full post bodies long-term.
- No scraping behind logins.

## UI

- Every report: `disclaimerVersion`, `generatedAt`, link to `/legal/disclaimer`.
- `confidence === "low"`: prominent caution — no false certainty.

## Human review (before ship)

Required human sign-off for changes to **`/legal/*`**, **grading logic**, or **external announcements** — not every commit.

## Copy discipline

Compliance text: **enough, not theatrical** — no extra legal bulk beyond MVP needs.

## Code review bar

UGC accusations, non-public data, or defamatory labels → stop; redesign per `docs/MVP.md` §2.4.
